{'symbol': 'TFC', 'date': '2019-12-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'BB&T CORPORATION ANNOUNCES REDEMPTION OF MEDIUM-TERM NOTES', 'text': 'BB&T CORPORATION ANNOUNCED THE REDEMPTION ON DECEMBER 15, 2019, OF ALL ITS OUTSTANDING (I) FIXED RATE MEDIUM-TERM NOTES, SERIES E (SENIOR), DUE JANUARY 15, 2020, (CUSIP NO. 05531FAS2) AND (II) FLOATING RATE MEDIUM-TERM NOTES, SERIES E (SENIOR), DUE JANUARY 15, 2020, (CUSIP NO. 05531FAT0). THE REDEMPTION PRICE FOR EACH OF THE MEDIUM-TERM NOTES WILL BE EQUAL TO 100% OF THE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT PLUS ACCRUED AND UNPAID INTEREST TO, BUT EXCLUDING, THE REDEMPTION DATE OF DECEMBER 15, 2019. SINCE DECEMBER 15, 2019, IS NOT A BUSINESS DAY, THE REDEMPTION PRICE WILL BE PAID ON THE NEXT BUSINESS DAY, DECEMBER 16, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'TFC', 'date': '2019-12-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'BB&T CORPORATION ANNOUNCES REDEMPTION OF MEDIUM-TERM NOTES', 'text': 'BB&T CORPORATION ANNOUNCED THE REDEMPTION ON DECEMBER 15, 2019, OF ALL ITS OUTSTANDING (I) FIXED RATE MEDIUM-TERM NOTES, SERIES E (SENIOR), DUE JANUARY 15, 2020, (CUSIP NO. 05531FAS2) AND (II) FLOATING RATE MEDIUM-TERM NOTES, SERIES E (SENIOR), DUE JANUARY 15, 2020, (CUSIP NO. 05531FAT0). THE REDEMPTION PRICE FOR EACH OF THE MEDIUM-TERM NOTES WILL BE EQUAL TO 100% OF THE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT PLUS ACCRUED AND UNPAID INTEREST TO, BUT EXCLUDING, THE REDEMPTION DATE OF DECEMBER 15, 2019. SINCE DECEMBER 15, 2019, IS NOT A BUSINESS DAY, THE REDEMPTION PRICE WILL BE PAID ON THE NEXT BUSINESS DAY, DECEMBER 16, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'TFC', 'date': '2019-12-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'BB&T CORPORATION ANNOUNCES REDEMPTION OF MEDIUM-TERM NOTES', 'text': 'BB&T CORPORATION ANNOUNCED THE REDEMPTION ON DECEMBER 15, 2019, OF ALL ITS OUTSTANDING (I) FIXED RATE MEDIUM-TERM NOTES, SERIES E (SENIOR), DUE JANUARY 15, 2020, (CUSIP NO. 05531FAS2) AND (II) FLOATING RATE MEDIUM-TERM NOTES, SERIES E (SENIOR), DUE JANUARY 15, 2020, (CUSIP NO. 05531FAT0). THE REDEMPTION PRICE FOR EACH OF THE MEDIUM-TERM NOTES WILL BE EQUAL TO 100% OF THE PRINCIPAL AMO